B.a6Z=new A.ie("It\u2019s Jumu\u2019ah","The best day the sun rises upon. Today: read Surah al-Kahf, send many salawat upon the Prophet \ufdfa, and catch the hour in which dua is answered.","Sahih al-Bukhari 893 \xb7 Sahih Muslim 854 \xb7 Abu Dawud 1048")
