B.a72=new A.ie("The Day of Arafah","For those not on Hajj: fasting today expiates the year before and the year after. And pour out dua \u2014 it is the best day of the year for it.","Sahih Muslim 1162 \xb7 Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3585")
B.a74=new A.ie("Tomorrow the White Days begin","The 13th, 14th and 15th \u2014 the nights of the full moon \u2014 the Prophet \ufdfa fasted them, and said three days of each month is like fasting a lifetime.",u.f)
